WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
CBS brought Holmes and Watson to modern New York. Three dates trace the run from pilot to finale.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.480
27 Sep 2012. The pilot begins the CBS run.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:18.320
3 Feb 2013. The drama airs after Super Bowl XLVII.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.800
15 Aug 2019. Their Last Bow closes the series.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.040
The complete chronology tracks the first season, the London shoot, title-sequence nominations and the final season.
